  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "8244692",
      "title": "Module Introduction & Starting Project",
      "sourceHash": "55fe6ae43a94e95c051c825a12b52b8b8a4d7019b0cec3eeb7d2aafe2bf6cc50",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.72,
          "end": 3.6,
          "en": "So now at this point in the course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.6,
          "end": 6.09,
          "en": "where you learned about more advanced",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.09,
          "end": 8.49,
          "en": "React features and techniques,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.49,
          "end": 11.64,
          "en": "it's again time to practice what you learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.64,
          "end": 15.9,
          "en": "and to put all these different concepts to work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.9,
          "end": 18.21,
          "en": "in a concrete example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.21,
          "end": 21.66,
          "en": "And therefore, in this course section here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.66,
          "end": 26.52,
          "en": "we are going to build another complete example project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.52,
          "end": 28.14,
          "en": "a food order app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.14,
          "end": 32.22,
          "en": "which allows users to browse different meals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.22,
          "end": 37.22,
          "en": "add those meals to a cart, edit those meals in the cart,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.38,
          "end": 40.2,
          "en": "and then proceed to a checkout form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.2,
          "end": 43.23,
          "en": "where they can then finally, in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.23,
          "end": 46.443,
          "en": "submit that order to a dummy backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.37,
          "end": 51.03,
          "en": "And whilst I'll provide the backend code to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.03,
          "end": 54.3,
          "en": "since this is no backend development course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.3,
          "end": 56.76,
          "en": "we'll build the entire front end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.76,
          "end": 59.64,
          "en": "from the ground up step by step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.64,
          "end": 62.79,
          "en": "Because that's the idea behind this section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.79,
          "end": 66.48,
          "en": "to build this complete project from the ground up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66.48,
          "end": 69.12,
          "en": "To build and configure components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.12,
          "end": 71.73,
          "en": "To work with state and context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.73,
          "end": 73.92,
          "en": "and see when we need what.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.92,
          "end": 78.51,
          "en": "To manage and send HTTP requests and side effects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.51,
          "end": 82.86,
          "en": "And to simply use all these features we covered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.86,
          "end": 87.48,
          "en": "over the last lectures and really over the entire course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 87.48,
          "end": 91.02,
          "en": "However, I also got a challenge for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 91.02,
          "end": 94.38,
          "en": "Definitely try building this application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.38,
          "end": 98.67,
          "en": "this project on your own without my help.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.67,
          "end": 102.81,
          "en": "As mentioned, I'll provide that dummy backend to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 102.81,
          "end": 105,
          "en": "and indeed, therefore attached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 105,
          "end": 107.55,
          "en": "you'll find this starting project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 107.55,
          "end": 111.93,
          "en": "Again, both a local and a CodeSandbox version.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 111.93,
          "end": 114.09,
          "en": "If you're using the local version,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 114.09,
          "end": 116.52000000000001,
          "en": "you'll need to run NPM install once",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 116.52000000000001,
          "end": 119.94,
          "en": "to install all the dependencies of this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 119.94,
          "end": 123.783,
          "en": "And you'll also need to do that in the backend folder once.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 125.25,
          "end": 127.35,
          "en": "And then once you run NPM install",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.35,
          "end": 129.15,
          "en": "in these two different places,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129.15,
          "end": 131.01,
          "en": "you'll need to run NPM start",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 131.01,
          "end": 134.67,
          "en": "in the backend folder and keep that process up and running.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 134.67,
          "end": 138.12,
          "en": "And then also switch back to the main project folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 138.12,
          "end": 142.11,
          "en": "and run NPM run dev to start that development server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 142.11,
          "end": 143.91,
          "en": "off the front end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 143.91,
          "end": 146.37,
          "en": "And then you should keep both processes up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 146.37,
          "end": 149.25,
          "en": "and running as long as you are working on the project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 149.25,
          "end": 151.95,
          "en": "If you are following along on CodeSandbox,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 151.95,
          "end": 154.68,
          "en": "you don't need to do either of that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 154.68,
          "end": 157.44,
          "en": "But with that starting project set up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.44,
          "end": 159.48,
          "en": "my challenge for you is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.48,
          "end": 162.96,
          "en": "that you do build this application from the ground up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.96,
          "end": 165.96,
          "en": "that you do add all those components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 165.96,
          "end": 170.34,
          "en": "that you do add the code to fetch dummy meals data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 170.34,
          "end": 173.1,
          "en": "that you do add the code to manage that cart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 173.1,
          "end": 176.37,
          "en": "and submit those orders to the dummy backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.37,
          "end": 178.59,
          "en": "That you really build everything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 178.59,
          "end": 181.2,
          "en": "except for the backend on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 181.2,
          "end": 183.27,
          "en": "Now, in that starting project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 183.27,
          "end": 188.27,
          "en": "you'll also find an index CSS file, which you of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 188.64,
          "end": 191.971,
          "en": "also can use as inspiration to get an idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 191.971,
          "end": 195.21,
          "en": "of which components you might want to add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 195.21,
          "end": 198.06,
          "en": "or which areas on the website you might to add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 198.06,
          "end": 198.893,
          "en": "But of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 198.893,
          "end": 201.39,
          "en": "you can also write all these styles on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 201.39,
          "end": 203.25,
          "en": "That is totally up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 203.25,
          "end": 206.4,
          "en": "But this challenge, of course, is a great opportunity",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 206.4,
          "end": 211,
          "en": "for you to apply what you learned in a realistic project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 211,
          "end": 215.091,
          "en": "Though I also want to make it clear that this here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 215.091,
          "end": 217.971,
          "en": "is definitely a difficult challenge",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 217.971,
          "end": 221.7,
          "en": "and that there will be more than one solution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 221.7,
          "end": 224.91,
          "en": "There won't be a single right solution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 224.91,
          "end": 228.48,
          "en": "Instead, there will be dozens of possible solutions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 228.48,
          "end": 232.74,
          "en": "So simply take this as a challenge to find your solution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 232.74,
          "end": 236.01,
          "en": "and take the remaining lectures in this section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 236.01,
          "end": 239.13,
          "en": "where I will walk you through my solution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 239.13,
          "end": 242.76,
          "en": "as an opportunity to compare your solution to mine",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 242.76,
          "end": 246.78,
          "en": "or to simply follow along and practice working with React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 246.78,
          "end": 249.66,
          "en": "if you don't wanna try this challenge on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 249.66,
          "end": 252.843,
          "en": "That's of course also absolutely fine.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
